accepted_decisions.operative_body:
That Council:
1. Proceed with consideration of Bylaw No. 1987, to amend the OCP designation of the
neighbourhoods identified by red hatching in Appendix A and as discussed in this report;
2. Proceed with consideration of Bylaw No. 1919 as drafted, to:
a) Amend the CC1 Zone to establish a 6-storey height limit;
b) Create the CCP and CC2 Zones as presented;
c)
Insert additional design guidelines including the City Centre Concept Map to support the
implementation of these City Centre Zones.
